Done. Here's what was changed:

**`config.py`**
- `UiConfig.startup_repo` default: `"all"` → `"current"`
- `load()` fallback: `"all"` → `"current"`

**`tui/app.py`**
- Added `_repo_filter: reactive[str]` and `_cwd_repo_label: str` — separates repo scope from text search
- `on_mount`: sets `_repo_filter = matched.label` instead of polluting the text input
- `_apply_filter`: passes `repo_label=self._repo_filter` to `filter_sessions`
- New `Binding("a", "toggle_all", "All")` — toggles between current repo and all repos
- `watch__repo_filter`: updates scope label below the filter input (`[dim]textsessions[/dim]` or `[dim]all repos[/dim]`)
- `Label(id="scope-label")` added to `compose()` between filter input and table
